            "action_name": {
              "value": "Choking Sands"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(air, earth, primal)\n\nThe sand wolf discorporates into a cloud of whirling sand. It can Stride, moving freely through occupied spaces. Any creatures within those spaces take 2d10 damage and must attempt a DC 19 Reflex save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target takes no damage.\n- **Success:** The target takes half damage.\n- **Failure:** The target takes full damage and is sickened 1.\n- **Critical Failure:** As failure, but the effect is increased to sickened 3."
            },
